      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. what is the goal ?\n-> develop a web application that can take any type of document as input \nin any language and translates into specified language.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "NdPnsDhBvaNyVPcP8qHiQ",
      "originalText": "1. what is the goal ?\n-> develop a web application that can take any type of document as input \nin any language and translates into specified language.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
