    {
      "id": "BZe0bBc6EiFOH7-3R4Ijf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 108.74999999999977,
      "y": -160.75,
      "width": 1040.559326171875,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 747706881,
      "version": 234,
      "versionNonce": 1106208193,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794748241006,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n2. What features to be implemented?\n-> 1. it should support multi language translation (source - desired)\n   2. it should support multiple documet formats like pdf,doc etc. (at initial level)\n   3. it should translate from source/given/docuemt language and translate it into\n      user specified language.\n   4. It should read from plain text but also it should \n      have the capability to extract text from images and then process it.\n  6. Text should be splitted in such a way that required page should be split on appropriate sentence end.\n  7. Since we are using google translator text chunking should be within limit (5000) characters. \n  8. If the page size exceeds the character limit then text should be splitted \n     at the last sentence end before character limit\n  9. It should use googles translation website API to implement it.\n 10. Web UI to be provided using Streamlit.\n 11. Page to be rendered with output appended as long as the translation done for the chunk.\n 12. Entire translation should be stored/saved in specified format.\n  \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fD7jZqcSkd-_FANYuraHX",
      "originalText": "\n2. What features to be implemented?\n-> 1. it should support multi language translation (source - desired)\n   2. it should support multiple documet formats like pdf,doc etc. (at initial level)\n   3. it should translate from source/given/docuemt language and translate it into\n      user specified language.\n   4. It should read from plain text but also it should \n      have the capability to extract text from images and then process it.\n  6. Text should be splitted in such a way that required page should be split on appropriate sentence end.\n  7. Since we are using google translator text chunking should be within limit (5000) characters. \n  8. If the page size exceeds the character limit then text should be splitted \n     at the last sentence end before character limit\n  9. It should use googles translation website API to implement it.\n 10. Web UI to be provided using Streamlit.\n 11. Page to be rendered with output appended as long as the translation done for the chunk.\n 12. Entire translation should be stored/saved in specified format.\n  \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
